Output assets/frostgate-demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "source docs/frostgate-demo-env.sh"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "frostgate --version"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "frostgate"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "frostgate recommend"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Hide
Type "cleanup_frostgate_demo"
Enter
